.TH PROXY 1 "2026-10-04" "mihomo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
proxy \- control the mihomo proxy (on/off, node, status)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B proxy
[\fIon\fR | \fIoff\fR | \fItoggle\fR | \fIstatus\fR [\fI--json\fR] | \fInode\fR [\fIgroup\fR] | \fIpanel\fR | \fIrestart\fR | \fIhelp\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B proxy
is a small helper around the headless
.BR mihomo (1)
instance managed by the user service
.IR mihomo.service .
It can turn the proxy on or off, find and switch to the fastest proxy node,
show the current engine/mode/node, and open the web panel.
.PP
The proxy engine listens on
.I 127.0.0.1:7897
(mixed) and
.I 127.0.0.1:7890
(HTTP); the control API and the web panel are served on
.IR 127.0.0.1:9097 .
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B on
Set mode to
.I rule
(rule\-based split routing) and make sure the service is running.
.TP
.B off
Set mode to
.I direct
(all traffic goes direct). The engine keeps running and the system proxy
environment variables stay valid. Prefer this over stopping the service:
stopping the service makes programs that honour
.B http_proxy
fail to connect.
.TP
.B toggle
Switch between
.I on
and
.IR off .
.TP
.B status
Print the engine state, current mode and current node. With
.I --json
print a single JSON object instead.
.TP
.BI node " [group]"
Delay\-test all nodes of the given selector group (default
.IR 节点选择)
in parallel and switch to the one with the lowest latency.
.TP
.B panel
Open the metacubexd web panel in a Chrome app window.
.TP
.B restart
Restart
.IR mihomo.service .
.TP
.B help
Show usage.
.SH SYSTEMD
The engine is a user service:
.PP
.nf
systemctl --user status  mihomo.service
systemctl --user start   mihomo.service
systemctl --user stop    mihomo.service
systemctl --user restart mihomo.service
systemctl --user enable  mihomo.service   # start on boot
systemctl --user disable mihomo.service
.fi
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MIHOMO_API
Base URL of the mihomo control API (default
.IR http://127.0.0.1:9097 ).
.TP
.B MIHOMO_SECRET
API secret (default
.IR set-your-secret ).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/mihomo/config.yaml
The mihomo configuration (subscription). Private to
.IR mihomo.service ;
the Clash Verge GUI no longer manages it.
.TP
.I ~/.config/mihomo/ui/
Local web panel assets (metacubexd) served at
.IR /ui/ .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mihomo (1),
.BR systemctl (1)
.SH NOTES
The noctalia status bar shows a shield icon
.RI ( plugin:mihomo-proxy ):
left click toggles rule/direct, right click opens the panel.
